*** Test Cases ***
CB008140-ET-GB015_framestructure selected for best TP with scell 81817 disable
    [Documentation]
    ...    This case is to check scell with large chbw ModulationOrder selected in IgNB-CA
    ...    81817 feature is to enable max TPUT calculation on ext-GNB DU,when 81817 is enabled
    ...    on pri-GNB,pri-GNB CU will send BC list to ext-GNB CU, ext-GNB CU will transfer BC list to 
    ...    ext-GNB DU so that DU can calculate max TPUT from BC list and select best BC.
    ...    [Configuration]:
    ...    Cell id=1 gnb=2 pci=16:2 tac=200 tdd_cell=on band=n77 nr_arfcn=663400:663400 gscn=8159 chBw=100MHz 
    ...    Cell id=3 gnb=3 pci=17:1 tac=200 tdd_cell=on band=n77 nr_arfcn=653400:653400 gscn=8072 chBw=100MHz
    ...    Cell id=4 gnb=3 pci=17:2 tac=200 tdd_cell=on band=n77 nr_arfcn=648000:648000 gscn=8000 chBw=100MHz 
    ...    Cell id=12 gnb=3 pci=20:1 tac=200 tdd_cell=off band=n28 nr_arfcn=153400:143400 gscn=1916 chBw=15MHz 
    ...    Cell 3,4,12 are on GNB2,cell1 is on GNB1, Cell 3,4,12 are configured as scells of Cell1.
    ...    Cell 3 and Cell 4 actDl256Qamtrue are true
    ...    Cell 3's tddFrameStructure.ulDlDataSlotRatio is 3/7(Dl 7/10)
    ...    Cell 4's tddFrameStructure.ulDlDataSlotRatio is 1/4(DL 8/10)
    ...    DL TPUT of Cell 4 as scell will bigger.
    ...    2.Test Case Steps:
    ...         a. UE Register And PDU Session Setup On NRCELL-1,CA T(CELL1)+T(CELL4)+F(CELL12) is setup.
    ...         b. Send Throuput and Verify Throuput 3CC on Pscell and Scell.
    ...         c. deregister UE
    [Tags]    GB015    QC_253277
    Ue Register And PDU Session Setup    ${SA_Capa_forGB015_UE}    ${expectpcell_GB015}     1    1    2    1    
    Send Throuput
    Wait Until Keyword Succeeds    60s    10s    Verify Throuput on Pscell
    Trigger A1MR    ${expectca_GB015}
    Wait Until Keyword Succeeds    60s    10s    Verify Throuput 3CC on Pscell and Scell 
    Release UEs    ue_type=all
    Check WireShark Log GNB2    ${CURDIR}${/}A2A_GB_015${/}a2a_gnb2.ini    wait_string=UEContextRelease::4
	
CB008140-ET-GB005_Scell deactivated due to switch to powersaving BWP and then reactivated due to switch to small BWP 
    [Documentation]
    ...    The purpose of this test case is to check Scell partial addition with one scell chbw not support when 
    ...    actEnhMultipleDedicatedBWPs enabled for IgNB-CA, and also check Scell deactivation and activation with powersaving BWP for IgNB-CA.
    ...    1.[Configuration]:
    ...      Cell-2(N77): Large Bandwidth 100MHz, Small Bandwidth 80MHz, PowerSaving Bandwith 60Mhz.
    ...      Cell-4(N77): Large Bandwidth 100MHz, Small Bandwidth 80MHz, PowerSaving Bandwith 60Mhz.
    ...      Cell-11(N3): Large Bandwidth 20MHz, Small Bandwidth 15MHz.
    ...      Cell-12(N28): Large Bandwidth 20MHz, Small Bandwidth 15MHz.	
    ...      Cell 4,11,12 are on GNB2,cell2 is on GNB1, Cell 4,11,12 are configured as scells of Cell2.
    ...    2.Test Case Steps:
    ...      a. UE attach to cell-2 and start both UL/DL traffic.
    ...      b. Trigger A1MR For Scell Addition And Check Throughput.
    ...      c. Decrease Traffic to Trigger BWP Switch to Powersaving.
    ...      d. Trigger A2MR to release cell12 And Check no scellchange A1 configured.
    ...      e. Increase Traffic to Trigger BWP Switch to Dedicate BWP.
    ...      f. Check Throughput Should Be Fine.
    ...      g. Deregister UE.
    [Tags]    GB005    Owner-yejing    QC_255204
    UE Attach And Send Throughput
    Trigger A1MR For Scell Addition And Check Throughput
    Decrease Traffic to Trigger BWP Switch to Powersaving
    Trigger A2MR And No A1 Configured
    Increase Traffic to Trigger BWP Switch to Dedicate BWP
    Wait Until Keyword Succeeds    30s    5s    Verify Throughput 2CC on Pscell and Scell
    Release UEs    ue_type=all

